umans-can-read-and-ai-bots-cannot-180989470/</guid></item><item><title>古罗马最大的壁画和马赛克建筑群描绘了一座神秘的海上城市，2000 年后向公众开放</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/ancient-romes-largest-fresco-and-mosaic-complex-featuring-depictions-of-a-mysterious-maritime-city-opens-to-the-public-after-2000-years-180989484/</link><description>这些大型艺术品创作于公元一世纪，于 20 世纪 90 年代在图拉真浴场的挖掘过程中被发现</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 15:31:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/ancient-romes-largest-fresco-and-mosaic-complex-featuring-depictions-of-a-mysterious-maritime-city-opens-to-the-public-after-2000-years-180989484/</guid></item><item><title>考古学家在一位生活在 25,000 年前的狩猎采集者的牙齿中发现了世界上最古老的习惯性吸毒证据</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-discover-the-worlds-oldest-evidence-of-habitual-drug-use-in-the-teeth-of-a-hunter-gatherer-who-lived-up-to-25000-years-ago-180989485/</link><description>此人可能经常吸食槟榔，槟榔以其改变思维的特性而闻名，导致牙齿疾病恶化。研究人员表示，这一发现揭示了史前环境中的成瘾现象</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 15:12:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-discover-the-worlds-oldest-evidence-of-habitual-drug-use-in-the-teeth-of-a-hunter-gatherer-who-lived-up-to-25000-years-ago-180989485/</guid></item><item><title>几十年来，科学家们一直认为“美国猎豹”曾在北美漫游。事实证明，灭绝的猫科动物并不是猎豹</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/for-decades-scientists-thought-an-american-cheetah-once-roamed-north-america-ancient-turns-out-the-extinct-cat-wasnt-a-cheetah-180989465/</link><description>怀俄明州和加拿大育空地区发现的化石中的古代 DNA 表明，与现代猎豹相比，野猫更类似于现代美洲狮</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/for-decades-scientists-thought-an-american-cheetah-once-roamed-north-america-ancient-turns-out-the-extinct-cat-wasnt-a-cheetah-180989465/</guid></item><item><title>转基因猪肾使一名男子存活了创纪录的九个月，使他能够等待捐赠的人体器官</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-genetically-modified-pig-kidney-kept-a-man-alive-for-a-record-nine-months-allowing-him-to-wait-for-a-donated-human-organ-180989466/</link><description>动物器官使蒂姆·安德鲁斯 (Tim Andrews) 连续 271 天无需透析，这也是猪肾首次被用作人体器官移植的桥梁</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-genetically-modified-pig-kidney-kept-a-man-alive-for-a-record-nine-months-allowing-him-to-wait-for-a-donated-human-organ-180989466/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能可能已经解决了一个长期存在的数学问题并获得了百万美元的奖金。它引发了关于谁获得荣誉的争议</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/ai-may-have-solved-a-longstanding-math-problem-with-a-million-dollar-prize-it-ignited-a-controversy-over-who-gets-credit-180989472/</link><description>OpenAI 宣布了纳维-斯托克斯问题的解决方案。但它的人工智能模型是否可以使用两位致力于类似突破的数学家的数据？</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 20:23:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/ai-may-have-solved-a-longstanding-math-problem-with-a-million-dollar-prize-it-ignited-a-controversy-over-who-gets-credit-180989472/</guid></item><item><title>美国女童子军宣布推出首个标志性饼干系列——专为狗设计的饼干</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/girl-scouts-of-america-announces-a-first-for-its-iconic-cookie-lineup-one-created-exclusively-for-dogs-180989479/</link><description>该组织在 109 年的饼干销售历史上首次为四足朋友提供定制甜点</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 19:28:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/girl-scouts-of-america-announces-a-first-for-its-iconic-cookie-lineup-one-created-exclusively-for-dogs-180989479/</guid></item><item><title>澳大利亚第二小的岩袋鼠在50年未见的地区再次出现</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/australias-second-smallest-rock-wallaby-reappears-in-a-region-where-it-had-not-been-seen-for-50-years-180989469/</link><description>濒临灭绝的纳巴勒克蜥蜴不容易被发现，也很难与类似物种区分开来。但一个研究小组对这些动物进行了新的检测，这为“它们的长期生存提供了好消息”</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 18:00:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/australias-second-smallest-rock-wallaby-reappears-in-a-region-where-it-had-not-been-seen-for-50-years-180989469/</guid></item><item><title>大英图书馆将世界最畅销小说家阿加莎·克里斯蒂的一生带入显微镜下</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-life-of-agatha-christie-the-worlds-best-selling-novelist-goes-under-the-microscope-at-the-british-library-180989480/</link><description>即将在伦敦举行的展览将通过信件、照片、打字机和夏威夷冲浪板的复制品来探索克里斯蒂“非凡”经历的广度</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 17:55:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-life-of-agatha-christie-the-worlds-best-selling-novelist-goes-under-the-microscope-at-the-british-library-180989480/</guid></item><item><title>塔斯马尼亚虎被称为牲畜杀手。新的研究挑战神话</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-tasmanian-tiger-was-branded-a-livestock-killer-new-research-challenges-that-myth-180989473/</link><description>袋狼具有强大的咬合力，适合捕捉袋狸等中小型猎物，而不是像欧洲殖民者担心的那样捕食羊和牛等大型动物</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 17:43:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-tasmanian-tiger-was-branded-a-livestock-killer-new-research-challenges-that-myth-180989473/</guid></item><item><title>这条蛇的尾巴尖看起来像蜘蛛。但它的内部骨骼却“异常正常”</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-tip-of-this-snakes-tail-looks-like-a-spider-but-inside-its-bones-are-bizarrely-normal-180989478/</link><description>高科技扫描首次详细展示了蜘蛛尾角毒蛇的内部解剖结构。这些发现揭示了鲜为人知的蛇椎骨，并强调了从骨骼预测动物的样子的难度</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 16:06:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/the-tip-of-this-snakes-tail-looks-like-a-spider-but-inside-its-bones-are-bizarrely-normal-180989478/</guid></item><item><title>“神奇”蘑菇中发现的迷幻化合物可能可以预防化疗引起的神经损伤和疼痛</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-psychedelic-compound-found-in-magic-mushrooms-might-prevent-debilitating-nerve-damage-and-pain-caused-by-chemotherapy-180989457/</link><description>一项针对小鼠和人体组织的研究表明，裸盖菇素可以预防周围神经病变，这是化疗的常见副作用。研究结果非常有希望，研究人员今年开始进行中期临床试验</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 15:48:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-psychedelic-compound-found-in-magic-mushrooms-might-prevent-debilitating-nerve-damage-and-pain-caused-by-chemotherapy-180989457/</guid></item><item><title>考古学家发现了一个新石器时代的人类骑着豹子的雕塑，这“与我们以前遇到过的任何东西都不一样”</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-uncover-a-neolithic-sculpture-of-a-human-riding-a-leopard-thats-unlike-anything-we-have-encountered-before-180989477/</link><description>这件文物是在土耳其东南部一处拥有 11,000 年历史的卡拉汉泰佩 (Karahan Tepe) 遗址的挖掘过程中发现的。这座 2.3 英尺高的雕塑早在文字发明之前就已创作，其用途仍是一个谜</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 14:09:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-uncover-a-neolithic-sculpture-of-a-human-riding-a-leopard-thats-unlike-anything-we-have-encountered-before-180989477/</guid></item><item><title>考古学家在波兰挖掘罗马时代墓地时惊讶地发现了一条由 42 颗牙齿制成的 5000 年前项链</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-excavating-a-roman-era-cemetery-in-poland-were-surprised-to-stumble-upon-a-5000-year-old-necklace-made-of-42-teeth-180989471/</link><description>这些珠宝由狼、鹿、熊甚至人类等大型哺乳动物的牙齿制成，是在波兰南部的一座坟墓中发现的，该坟墓可能属于绳纹器文化的一位重要族长</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 21:05:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-excavating-a-roman-era-cemetery-in-poland-were-surprised-to-stumble-upon-a-5000-year-old-necklace-made-of-42-teeth-180989471/</guid></item><item><title>令研究人员惊讶的是，这种巨型恐龙在寒冷的气候下产卵</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/to-researchers-surprise-this-giant-dinosaur-laid-eggs-in-a-cold-climate-180989474/</link><description>一项新的研究表明，泰坦巨龙利用腐烂的植被来为它们的蛋保暖，就像今天的鳄鱼一样</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 20:29:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/to-researchers-surprise-this-giant-dinosaur-laid-eggs-in-a-cold-climate-180989474/</guid></item><item><title>一枚具有 132 年历史的“传奇”10 美分硬币最近在拍卖会上以超过 120 万美元的价格售出。是什么让它如此非凡？</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-legendary-132-year-old-dime-recently-sold-for-more-than-12-million-at-auction-what-makes-it-so-extraordinary-180989476/</link><description>1894 年 6 月，旧金山仅铸造了 24 枚 1894-S 巴伯 10 分硬币，而目前已知的标本仅存 9 枚</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 19:33:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-legendary-132-year-old-dime-recently-sold-for-more-than-12-million-at-auction-what-makes-it-so-extraordinary-180989476/</guid></item><item><title>这艘医院船在第二次世界大战期间在阿尔巴尼亚海岸沉没。现在，这里充满了海洋生物</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-hospital-ship-sank-off-albania-coast-during-world-war-ii-now-its-teeming-with-marine-life-180989468/</link><description>对“波”号的一项新调查揭示了欣欣向荣的水下生态系统，其中包括稀有的地中海僧海豹</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 17:57:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-hospital-ship-sank-off-albania-coast-during-world-war-ii-now-its-teeming-with-marine-life-180989468/</guid></item><item><title>世界上最大的连环杀手“杀人狂”收藏（从约翰·韦恩·盖西到 HH·福尔摩斯）在芝加哥开幕</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/worlds-largest-collection-of-serial-killer-murderabilia-from-john-wayne-gacy-to-hh-holmes-opens-in-chicago-180989461/</link><description>令人毛骨悚然的新展览将展出 2,000 多件属于或与来自世界各地的约 150 名连环杀手有关的物品</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 14:24:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/worlds-largest-collection-of-serial-killer-murderabilia-from-john-wayne-gacy-to-hh-holmes-opens-in-chicago-180989461/</guid></item></channel></rss>